WEBVTT

00:01:36.850 --> 00:01:39.850
Arata, my new Shinsho.

00:01:40.970 --> 00:01:44.080
Please, hear my request.

00:01:45.100 --> 00:01:46.410
Request?

00:01:47.170 --> 00:01:51.260
Your words during the deliberation 
made me very happy.

00:01:52.240 --> 00:01:54.510
That was when I knew

00:01:55.210 --> 00:01:57.800
that your heart would open the path.

00:01:58.270 --> 00:01:59.790
Open the path?

00:02:00.990 --> 00:02:03.870
Until now, I have used the Amatsuriki

00:02:03.870 --> 00:02:06.060
to keep the Hayagami together as one

00:02:06.360 --> 00:02:08.400
and to control their Kamui.

00:02:09.090 --> 00:02:11.090
However, now that I have fallen,

00:02:11.660 --> 00:02:14.360
the Hayagami have been freed.

00:02:17.690 --> 00:02:21.900
If the Sho who wield the Hayagami 
begin to use the Kamui freely,

00:02:22.460 --> 00:02:25.760
that power will take control over 
the world, distorting justice,

00:02:26.540 --> 00:02:29.250
and the people will cry out in agony.

00:02:30.240 --> 00:02:35.770
This body, this life, 
is somehow still alive,

00:02:36.270 --> 00:02:37.510
but for how long, I do not know.

00:02:38.250 --> 00:02:39.600
No...

00:02:39.600 --> 00:02:40.670
Arata.

00:02:41.480 --> 00:02:42.470
Yes?

00:02:43.040 --> 00:02:47.680
I want you to lead 
Amawakuni in my place.

00:02:49.010 --> 00:02:54.510
And I want you to bring your Hayagami 
to me before my life runs out.

00:02:56.920 --> 00:02:58.650
I can't.

00:02:59.370 --> 00:03:01.290
I don't have any power.

00:03:02.270 --> 00:03:03.400
I can't do that.

00:03:04.210 --> 00:03:05.100
Please...

00:03:07.950 --> 00:03:09.310
I can only

00:03:12.030 --> 00:03:13.330
trust you.

00:03:16.820 --> 00:03:19.210
Trust me?

00:03:20.570 --> 00:03:24.550
The Reckoning

00:03:26.110 --> 00:03:27.790
Lead a nation...

00:03:29.500 --> 00:03:32.440
Can I really do that?

00:03:32.440 --> 00:03:33.480
Of course you can!

00:03:34.470 --> 00:03:37.000
Princess Kikuri trusts you.

00:03:37.810 --> 00:03:39.440
I trust you, too.

00:03:40.240 --> 00:03:44.400
And, I think you should keep the 
Hayagami carefully put away.

00:03:44.730 --> 00:03:46.830
Put away? Where?

00:03:47.990 --> 00:03:49.790
Let's see...

00:03:50.580 --> 00:03:51.860
How about here?

00:03:56.350 --> 00:03:58.410
People who have become Sho

00:03:58.410 --> 00:04:01.300
can house the Hayagami 
within their bodies.

00:04:01.640 --> 00:04:03.570
I-I see...

00:04:10.110 --> 00:04:12.430
This is so freaky.

00:04:14.190 --> 00:04:15.900
I can see the island!

00:04:19.330 --> 00:04:21.520
So that's Gatoya?

00:04:40.800 --> 00:04:42.150
Is something wrong?

00:04:42.600 --> 00:04:44.380
No... Maybe I was imagining it.

00:04:44.830 --> 00:04:46.010
Get moving!

00:04:47.250 --> 00:04:50.370
So the new sinner is here...

00:04:50.940 --> 00:04:52.960
with his tainted soul...

00:05:02.750 --> 00:05:05.180
Don't leave my side.

00:05:05.540 --> 00:05:06.480
Right.

00:05:11.740 --> 00:05:13.200
Princess killer.

00:05:14.660 --> 00:05:15.370
Him?

00:05:15.370 --> 00:05:16.900
He's just a kid.

00:05:16.900 --> 00:05:18.060
He brought a woman?

00:05:18.060 --> 00:05:19.300
Killer.

00:05:19.300 --> 00:05:20.120
He killed her.

00:05:20.120 --> 00:05:22.650
He killed the princess.

00:05:22.650 --> 00:05:24.140
He killed her.

00:05:24.140 --> 00:05:25.280
That kid?

00:05:34.600 --> 00:05:36.550
So you're the newbie I've heard about?

00:05:36.550 --> 00:05:37.480
Heard about?

00:05:40.420 --> 00:05:43.480
You're gonna give me your 
clothes and all your stuff.

00:05:43.480 --> 00:05:44.360
All your stuff!

00:05:50.300 --> 00:05:53.340
Bro, a hot girl! 
There's a hot girl with him!

00:05:53.340 --> 00:05:54.200
Y-Yeah!

00:05:54.200 --> 00:05:55.440
What should we do, Bro?

00:05:55.960 --> 00:05:57.360
What do you mean, what?

00:05:56.280 --> 00:05:57.360
Now's our chance.

00:05:57.360 --> 00:05:58.420
First,

00:05:58.420 --> 00:06:01.000
we take off the princess killer's head!

00:06:04.520 --> 00:06:05.550
Master Arata!

00:06:07.870 --> 00:06:09.510
That's it! Get him, Bro!

00:06:10.640 --> 00:06:12.100
Hold on! Hey!

00:06:16.530 --> 00:06:17.370
Master Arata!

00:06:17.370 --> 00:06:18.850
That's my Bro!

00:06:20.090 --> 00:06:22.160
So you're just a coward 
who does nothing but run?

00:06:22.820 --> 00:06:26.360
I'm impressed someone like you 
was able to kill the princess!

00:06:26.360 --> 00:06:29.070
No! I didn't...

00:06:31.890 --> 00:06:33.950
Uh oh, it's starting!

00:06:33.950 --> 00:06:35.040
The Reckoning!

00:06:35.330 --> 00:06:37.620
It's the Hour of Reckoning! Run!

00:06:39.140 --> 00:06:40.570
Hour of Reckoning?

00:06:41.370 --> 00:06:42.920
Bro, hurry!

00:06:43.840 --> 00:06:45.130
We'll finish this fight later!

00:06:49.950 --> 00:06:51.970
Are you all right, Master Arata?

00:07:18.880 --> 00:07:20.090
It ate them.

00:07:22.670 --> 00:07:24.790
What was that?

00:07:26.820 --> 00:07:28.300
That was The Reckoning.

00:07:29.130 --> 00:07:30.550
Warden Tsutsuga's, that is.

00:07:30.890 --> 00:07:33.720
Reckoning? Warden Tsutsuga?

00:07:33.720 --> 00:07:37.970
What, were you sent here 
without being told what you'd be up against?

00:07:38.550 --> 00:07:42.750
Warden Tsutsuga is the warden 
of this penal colony, Gatoya.

00:07:42.750 --> 00:07:46.820
Once a day, he chooses two 
criminals from among us

00:07:46.820 --> 00:07:48.690
and, as you just saw, "eats" them.

00:07:49.540 --> 00:07:51.890
What happens to them?

00:07:51.890 --> 00:07:54.530
My, now that I look closer, 
you're a good-looking boy.

00:07:56.590 --> 00:07:58.470
That's the end of them, of course.

00:08:01.200 --> 00:08:02.810
Well, there you have it.

00:08:02.810 --> 00:08:03.620
Hey!

00:08:04.320 --> 00:08:05.860
This is my fee for that information.

00:08:06.390 --> 00:08:07.520
Well, good luck.

00:08:10.860 --> 00:08:12.810
Just what is this place?

00:08:20.210 --> 00:08:23.350
The Twelve Shinsho are 
returning to their own lands.

00:08:24.060 --> 00:08:25.550
With the princess gone...

00:08:26.250 --> 00:08:28.520
What's going to happen to us?

00:08:36.470 --> 00:08:40.580
So there really is no record 
of that sword or its Kamui.

00:08:43.150 --> 00:08:46.040
Akachi, you haven't left yet?

00:08:46.780 --> 00:08:48.910
There's something I want to know first.

00:08:49.450 --> 00:08:54.010
Why did you send that 
boy, Arata, to Gatoya?

00:08:55.240 --> 00:08:57.510
I should've known I couldn't deceive you.

00:08:58.180 --> 00:08:59.890
There's something I want to find out.

00:09:00.450 --> 00:09:03.700
Once I know more details, 
I'll report to you.

00:09:04.530 --> 00:09:07.350
I see. Well, I'll look forward to it.

00:09:07.860 --> 00:09:10.360
But don't act on your own too much.

00:09:10.720 --> 00:09:12.470
Yes, I know.

00:09:33.330 --> 00:09:35.820
What's going to happen now?

00:09:54.450 --> 00:09:55.760
Appear!

00:09:57.830 --> 00:09:59.270
It still won't work.

00:10:00.800 --> 00:10:01.860
Who's there?!

00:10:07.420 --> 00:10:09.330
I found a great place!

00:10:10.140 --> 00:10:12.300
Oh, it's you, Kotoha.

00:10:13.870 --> 00:10:16.220
Ah, I feel alive again.

00:10:16.220 --> 00:10:19.290
It looks like the pipes are connected 
to an underground water vein.

00:10:19.740 --> 00:10:21.470
Oh, really?

00:10:22.110 --> 00:10:23.820
Shall I wash your back?

00:10:26.290 --> 00:10:28.480
That's all right! 
When did you come in, anyway?!

00:10:28.480 --> 00:10:29.620
Ow...

00:10:29.620 --> 00:10:30.910
What's wrong?

00:10:30.910 --> 00:10:33.150
When we were attacked 
earlier, I sort of...

00:10:34.640 --> 00:10:36.510
Leave that to me.

00:10:46.350 --> 00:10:48.320
It's healed! How?!

00:10:48.320 --> 00:10:50.700
You still don't have 
your memories back.

00:10:51.430 --> 00:10:54.200
Women of the Uneme Clan are
 endowed with this power

00:10:54.200 --> 00:10:56.550
to protect the Hime Clan 
masters they serve.

00:10:58.170 --> 00:10:59.750
Please relax.

00:11:03.890 --> 00:11:05.770
<i>It feels warm.</i>

00:11:06.990 --> 00:11:09.140
<i>I feel calmer.</i>

00:11:09.860 --> 00:11:12.230
<i>It kind of feels like Mom.</i>

00:11:13.850 --> 00:11:15.370
Have you calmed down?

00:11:15.790 --> 00:11:18.900
The Uneme power isn't 
just for healing wounds.

00:11:25.480 --> 00:11:28.750
<i>I was only thinking of myself.</i>

00:11:29.380 --> 00:11:32.510
<i>She came with me because 
she trusted me.</i>

00:11:34.490 --> 00:11:35.330
Kotoha.

00:11:35.890 --> 00:11:36.750
Yes?

00:11:37.490 --> 00:11:40.280
Um, thank you for everyth—

00:11:42.240 --> 00:11:43.400
That sound...

00:11:43.400 --> 00:11:44.600
The Hour of Reckoning?!

00:11:49.840 --> 00:11:51.020
Master Arata!

00:11:57.730 --> 00:12:00.280
Kotoha! Kotoha!

00:12:12.560 --> 00:12:14.320
Master Arata...

00:12:14.320 --> 00:12:15.040
Kotoha...

00:12:15.420 --> 00:12:17.380
Damn it! Damn it! Damn it!

00:12:31.290 --> 00:12:34.520
Excuse me, I'm looking for 
a girl who fell down here!

00:12:34.890 --> 00:12:36.360
A girl with long hair.

00:12:36.930 --> 00:12:38.090
Did anyone see her?!

00:12:40.240 --> 00:12:41.840
Princess killer.

00:12:43.840 --> 00:12:45.920
If we take off his head...

00:12:45.920 --> 00:12:47.910
...we can get out of here.

00:12:47.910 --> 00:12:49.540
Princess killer.

00:12:49.850 --> 00:12:51.910
No! I didn't...

00:12:58.050 --> 00:13:00.190
Damn it! Where'd he run to?!

00:13:00.190 --> 00:13:01.600
That's one quick kid!

00:13:06.760 --> 00:13:09.980
I couldn't save Kotoha.

00:13:10.460 --> 00:13:13.320
My legs froze, and I couldn't move.

00:13:13.900 --> 00:13:15.210
Why do you weep?

00:13:19.120 --> 00:13:20.770
Why do you weep?

00:13:22.810 --> 00:13:24.580
Who are you?

00:13:24.580 --> 00:13:27.950
Are you not a Sho chosen by a Hayagami?

00:13:29.100 --> 00:13:31.500
Why must a Sho weep?

00:13:31.500 --> 00:13:32.580
How do you know that?!

00:13:33.730 --> 00:13:35.290
Why do you weep?

00:13:37.610 --> 00:13:41.240
Because I can't live up to 
the trust she had in me.

00:13:41.860 --> 00:13:44.050
I couldn't save the 
one who trusted me.

00:13:44.740 --> 00:13:47.380
Will you betray those 
who trusted you, as well?

00:13:48.810 --> 00:13:50.800
Will you betray them, as well?

00:13:51.680 --> 00:13:53.810
Will I betray them?

00:13:54.820 --> 00:13:57.310
The people who trusted me...

00:13:58.010 --> 00:14:00.550
That's... That's...

00:14:02.650 --> 00:14:03.690
It's gone.

00:14:05.920 --> 00:14:07.200
What are you doing?

00:14:08.580 --> 00:14:11.120
If you're too loud, they'll find you.

00:14:11.400 --> 00:14:14.830
Are you lost? Want me 
to show you the way?

00:14:15.320 --> 00:14:16.730
Who are you?

00:14:16.730 --> 00:14:18.990
I'm Osome. And you?

00:14:19.340 --> 00:14:21.030
I-I'm Arata.

00:14:21.030 --> 00:14:22.670
Hmm... Arata...

00:14:22.670 --> 00:14:26.480
So if I take off your head, 
the big guy will approve,

00:14:26.480 --> 00:14:28.340
and I can get out of here?

00:14:29.360 --> 00:14:32.140
I'm kidding. That's just a stupid rumor.

00:14:32.490 --> 00:14:35.260
Anyway, where's the 
girl who was with you?

00:14:36.970 --> 00:14:40.940
I should've known. So she's 
the one who got lost.

00:14:41.800 --> 00:14:42.980
Do you know something?

00:14:43.800 --> 00:14:45.780
What if I do?

00:14:51.240 --> 00:14:54.620
The information fee. Please, tell me!

00:15:00.300 --> 00:15:03.510
They say Kanate took a girl who looked 
like her and went off somewhere.

00:15:03.510 --> 00:15:04.360
Kanate?

00:15:04.930 --> 00:15:07.340
The red-haired kid who attacked you.

00:15:08.370 --> 00:15:12.550
He's a bad seed. You'd better hurry.

00:15:13.060 --> 00:15:14.040
And...

00:15:14.990 --> 00:15:16.560
You can have that for free this time.

00:15:18.290 --> 00:15:19.580
Just get going.

00:15:19.580 --> 00:15:21.620
Uh... Thank you!

00:15:25.320 --> 00:15:27.970
I should know very 
well how painful it is

00:15:28.700 --> 00:15:30.790
when you can't see the one 
who's precious to you.

00:15:31.660 --> 00:15:34.230
Oh! So your name's Kotoha-chan!

00:15:34.230 --> 00:15:35.330
Oh!

00:15:35.730 --> 00:15:40.150
Kanate-san and Ginchi-san, 
thank you for saving me.

00:15:40.150 --> 00:15:42.500
Hey, it was nothing.

00:15:43.170 --> 00:15:46.090
But why did you save me?

00:15:46.090 --> 00:15:48.010
Well, because...

00:15:48.010 --> 00:15:50.850
Hey, Bro, I'm gonna get some food.

00:15:51.510 --> 00:15:52.720
What're you talking about?

00:15:52.720 --> 00:15:54.210
Be right back!

00:15:54.210 --> 00:15:56.350
H-Hey, hold on! Ginchi!

00:15:57.670 --> 00:15:59.930
Um... Where is Master Arata?

00:16:06.930 --> 00:16:09.080
Go get 'er, Bro!

00:16:11.330 --> 00:16:12.280
Kotoha...

00:16:24.540 --> 00:16:27.540
Will Master Arata be all right alone?

00:16:27.920 --> 00:16:32.050
<i>I-I don't know what to 
do alone with a girl.</i>

00:16:33.510 --> 00:16:36.280
I'm gonna go check on Ginchi.

00:16:36.280 --> 00:16:40.310
Don't you dare leave this room! Got it?

00:16:40.940 --> 00:16:42.630
S-Sure...

00:16:47.120 --> 00:16:48.850
I'm in over my head.

00:16:53.150 --> 00:16:54.240
Ginchi!

00:16:55.490 --> 00:16:57.120
You!

00:16:57.590 --> 00:16:58.370
Hold on!

00:16:58.370 --> 00:16:59.120
Shut up!

00:17:01.090 --> 00:17:02.750
Is this your retaliation for before?!

00:17:02.750 --> 00:17:04.090
No! I...

00:17:04.090 --> 00:17:05.750
What did <i>you</i> do with Kotoha?!

00:17:05.750 --> 00:17:09.230
I'm not giving the girl back to you!

00:17:10.910 --> 00:17:12.920
A sword?! Where'd that come from?!

00:17:16.850 --> 00:17:18.980
Are you in love with that girl, too?

00:17:18.980 --> 00:17:20.880
No! It's not like that!

00:17:21.620 --> 00:17:25.730
She's saved me so many times 
since I came to this world.

00:17:26.150 --> 00:17:27.700
She's encouraged me so many times.

00:17:28.210 --> 00:17:30.440
She trusted me.

00:17:31.100 --> 00:17:32.900
So now it's my turn!

00:17:33.820 --> 00:17:35.530
I will protect her!

00:17:36.020 --> 00:17:37.530
Give Kotoha back to me!

00:17:39.370 --> 00:17:40.200
Bro...

00:17:42.220 --> 00:17:44.160
Are you okay, Ginchi?

00:17:44.990 --> 00:17:48.170
You're... You're wrong, Bro.

00:17:48.170 --> 00:17:50.340
Wrong? About what?!

00:17:51.890 --> 00:17:53.510
We found you, Ginchi!

00:17:54.840 --> 00:17:56.880
This is to thank you for before!

00:18:07.780 --> 00:18:10.360
Damn, I hit him hard.

00:18:10.360 --> 00:18:11.730
Is he okay?

00:18:14.040 --> 00:18:16.070
Bluebeard Zanji's minion?

00:18:16.910 --> 00:18:20.820
When I was in trouble, he got me out.

00:18:25.720 --> 00:18:29.200
But then I blacked out and...

00:18:29.840 --> 00:18:30.750
My ring...

00:18:31.180 --> 00:18:32.850
They took it?

00:18:34.360 --> 00:18:36.340
Sorry! Look after Ginchi!

00:18:36.340 --> 00:18:36.760
Huh?

00:18:38.890 --> 00:18:40.040
H-Hey...

00:18:43.990 --> 00:18:47.180
When I was a kid, I was kidnapped 
by a gang of thieves.

00:18:47.890 --> 00:18:49.980
That's where I met Bro.

00:18:51.010 --> 00:18:53.750
But when the gang got into trouble,

00:18:54.230 --> 00:18:57.580
I don't know why, but we were 
framed for what happened.

00:18:58.110 --> 00:18:59.950
That's how we ended up in Gatoya.

00:19:01.020 --> 00:19:02.180
My ring...

00:19:02.650 --> 00:19:04.910
Mom gave it to me 
before we were separated.

00:19:05.500 --> 00:19:07.980
It's my one and only treasure.

00:19:09.670 --> 00:19:11.970
That's why he went 
to get the ring back.

00:19:12.430 --> 00:19:15.240
Bro has always protected me.

00:19:16.230 --> 00:19:17.800
We made a promise.

00:19:18.350 --> 00:19:21.050
One day, we'll get out of here together.

00:19:23.950 --> 00:19:25.450
Okay, all done.

00:19:25.450 --> 00:19:28.310
Huh? Wow! It doesn't hurt!

00:19:28.310 --> 00:19:29.440
Oh, good.

00:19:30.740 --> 00:19:32.500
Thanks, Kotoha-neechan!

00:19:32.500 --> 00:19:33.150
Not at all.

00:19:37.420 --> 00:19:38.940
I'm glad you're okay.

00:19:38.940 --> 00:19:41.850
I'm relieved that you're 
safe as well, Master Arata.

00:19:42.320 --> 00:19:48.500
I wasn't sure at all if I could handle 
what the princess asked me to do.

00:19:49.210 --> 00:19:50.310
But I'll try.

00:19:50.820 --> 00:19:53.560
To live up to the trust 
that she had in me,

00:19:54.210 --> 00:19:58.130
I'll definitely bring 
the Hayagami to her.

00:19:59.510 --> 00:20:02.340
Okay! Let's see it through together!

00:20:04.620 --> 00:20:06.370
Now that that's settled,

00:20:06.370 --> 00:20:09.310
all that's left is to find 
a way to get out of here.

00:20:09.870 --> 00:20:11.820
But to do that...

00:20:11.820 --> 00:20:13.100
It's impossible.

00:20:14.050 --> 00:20:17.190
If you're planning to do something 
to Warden Tsutsuga, it's impossible.

00:20:17.690 --> 00:20:20.350
Warden Tsutsuga is a Sho 
who wields a Hayagami.

00:20:20.900 --> 00:20:22.150
No way we can defy him.

00:20:22.750 --> 00:20:23.560
A Sho?

00:20:26.390 --> 00:20:27.570
Bro!

00:20:28.480 --> 00:20:29.350
There.

00:20:30.490 --> 00:20:33.300
Keep it stashed away from now 
on so nobody can take it.

00:20:33.300 --> 00:20:34.110
Okay!

00:20:34.740 --> 00:20:37.670
You took care of Ginchi for me. Thanks.

00:20:38.350 --> 00:20:41.190
Kotoha says you saved her.

00:20:41.570 --> 00:20:43.380
I should thank you.

00:20:44.820 --> 00:20:46.140
That means...

00:20:46.570 --> 00:20:48.330
We're even now!

00:20:48.330 --> 00:20:49.180
Bro!

00:20:49.700 --> 00:20:52.370
Do you really believe that 
you can get out of here

00:20:52.370 --> 00:20:53.690
if you take off my head?

00:20:54.470 --> 00:20:56.300
I have to get out of here!

00:20:56.760 --> 00:20:57.820
